# .docpairs — the doc-implication map.
#
# Each line pairs a code surface with the document that describes it. The map
# is DATA for the judgment gate: when a pull request changes paths matching a
# glob on the left, the document on the right is IMPLICATED — the judge
# receives its full content alongside the diff and rules on whether the change
# falsifies it. A falsified, un-updated implicated document is a bounce.
#
# Nothing mechanical counts touches against this file (ADR-0002: doc pairing
# binds through the judge). Keep pairs few and obviously true.
#
# Format: one pairing per line, "<glob> -> <doc path>"; "#" comments.

pkg/httpapi/**  -> docs/api.md
Taskfile.yml    -> docs/operations.md
config/**       -> docs/operations.md
